or a possibly clipped sprite.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/5adee1b2.py:167:    \"\"\"Choose non-overlapping object origins; returns placement tuples or None on retry exhaustion.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/5adee1b2.py:196:    \"\"\"Render the paired output and return the generated input with halo-fill cells removed.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/5adee1b2.py:260:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/465b7d93.py:96:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/465b7d93.py:97:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/465b7d93.py:100:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/465b7d93.py:106:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/465b7d93.py:114:    Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/465b7d93.py:117:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/465b7d93.py:260:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py:51:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py:52:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py:55:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py:60:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py:65:    Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py:67:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py:251:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:9:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:14:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:38:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:39:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:42:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:46:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:52:    Key insight: The legend pairs (overlapping two-color glyphs outside the frame) dictate the final recoloring — placeholder color selects the shape, legend maps it to the output color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:53:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:238:    \"\"\"Build a 3x4 legend block mapping src color to tgt color.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:246:    \"\"\"Generate a random NxN binary mask with fill ratio in [SPRITE_FILL_MIN, SPRITE_FILL_MAX].\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:280:    \"\"\"Render a binary mask as a colored sprite on bg.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:287:    \"\"\"Content area needed for grid_rows x grid_cols of NxN blocks with 1-cell gaps.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:292:    \"\"\"Pick (n, rows, cols, empty_count, total) satisfying frame size constraints.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:311:    \"\"\"Choose which grid slots are empty, ensuring every row and column has at least one filled slot.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:314:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:329:    \"\"\"Create an h x w frame filled with bg and a 1-cell FRAME_COL border.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:340:    \"\"\"Find a free location for patch and paste it onto grid/reserve. Returns success.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/edb79dae.py:439:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/2ccd9fef.py:172:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/2ccd9fef.py:173:    \"\"\"Predict the next panel in a framed sequence by continuing each scheduled colored interval.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/2ccd9fef.py:187:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/2ccd9fef.py:404:    \"\"\"Return full-panel masks by color index, or None if any blob fails.\"\"\"\n/home/lix